holoparasite-picker-host-occupied = That being already hosts a parasite of its own.

holoparasite-variant-standard-caption = Anchor
holoparasite-variant-standard-synopsis = A dependable, balanced symbiont suited to any engagement.
holoparasite-variant-standard-lore = Blunt and structural hits ignore armor. Predictable speed, steady durability.

holoparasite-variant-assassin-caption = Wraith
holoparasite-variant-assassin-synopsis = A toxin-laced shroud that is nearly invisible while it holds still.
holoparasite-variant-assassin-lore = Fades from sight in place and betrays itself only by movement. Laces every strike with poison.

holoparasite-variant-charger-caption = Dart
holoparasite-variant-charger-synopsis = A blistering presence that barrages across the battlefield.
holoparasite-variant-charger-lore = Exceptional movement speed. Leaps via Stomp, knocking down whatever it plows through.

holoparasite-variant-brawler-caption = Torch
holoparasite-variant-brawler-synopsis = A searing manifestation whose every blow leaves victims burning.
holoparasite-variant-brawler-lore = Hits ignore armor and ignite the target. Strikes land slower in exchange.

holoparasite-variant-icicle-caption = Drift
holoparasite-variant-icicle-synopsis = A frost-warded presence that leeches strength with each shard-tipped blow.
holoparasite-variant-icicle-lore = Raw Cold damage on top of stamina drain, staggering the unwary.

holoparasite-variant-protector-caption = Aegis
holoparasite-variant-protector-synopsis = A ponderous bulwark that anchors to its owner and swallows harm.
holoparasite-variant-protector-lore = Absorbs far more of its master's damage and may roam farther from them.